fatal: Not possible to fast-forward, aborting.
comms-sync: import diverged: BOTH nodes advanced against origin (the one real semantic conflict).
  Recipe (execute by hand, deliberately):
    1) mv /tmp/cgt2/evfix/comms/<user>/<date>-NN /tmp/collide
    2) git -C /tmp/cgt2/evfix/comms pull --ff-only
    3) mv /tmp/collide /tmp/cgt2/evfix/comms/<user>/<date>-NN.<this-node>
  The suffixed copy stays on disk as a distinct foreign session (session scripts
  read it but sequence discovery excludes non-standard suffixes) — reconcile the
  CONTENT in the next session's handoff, then commit.
